ame \\\"*.env\\\" -o -name \\\".env*\\\" 2>/dev/null | head -5; cat /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md | grep -i \\\"github\\\\|token\\\\|ssh\\\" 2>/dev/null | head -10\"}}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"usage\":{\"input\":60,\"output\":176,\"cacheRead\":33312,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":33548,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1779581092395,\"responseId\":\"066173a5e112fd26e9728f756a6cc5ba\"}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"21c9f888\",\"parentId\":\"c6c12fd8\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-24T00:05:04.524Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_function_hc6gmxewh51l_1\",\"toolName\":\"exec\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/outputs/codus/skill-tee-prototype/.env.example\\n- SSH hosts and aliases\\n- ⚠️ APP_SECRET可能已失效（code 10014），如遇无效token需找听风(Lucifer)更新凭证\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"durationMs\":3642,\"aggregated\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/outputs/codus/skill-tee-prototype/.env.example\\n- SSH hosts and aliases\\n- ⚠️ APP_SECRET可能已失效（code 10014），如遇无效token需找听风(Lucifer)更新凭证\",\"cwd\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\"},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1779581104522}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"993fa985\",\"parentId\":\"21c9f888\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-24T00:05:15.815Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"SSH is not available, no GitHub token found. This is a cron backup job - I should just log that the commit was made but push failed due to environment limitations. The commit 49e443077 exists locally. \\n\\nLet me check if there's any way to push via GitHub CLI or API, or just note the failure and that the commit exists locally.\\n\\nActually, there's nothing more I can do here without credentials. I should report the situation cleanly.\\n\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"52b58f4122d3628ba5b6b810a27c6b41b187a552ff3a31d9d9554dc4b893efaa\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\n\\n备份状态：\\n\\n**已完成：**\\n- ✅ `git add -A` — 475个文件暂存\\n- ✅ `git commit -m \\\"auto backup 2026-05-24\\\"` — 提交成功 (49e443077)\\n- ❌ `git push` — 失败\\n\\n**原因：** 环境中没有 `ssh` 客户端，且没有 GitHub 认证凭证（无 `.netrc`、无 `gh`、无 `GITHUB_TOKEN`）\\n\\n**修复方案（选一个）：**\\n1. 安装 `openssh-client` — 需要 root 权限\\n2. 配置 GitHub token 到 `.netrc` 或环境变量\\n3. 配置 `gh` CLI — 需要人工授权\\n\\n本地提交已存在，等凭证配置好后下次 cron 会自动 push。\"}],\"api\":\"anthropic-messages\",\"provider\":\"minimax-portal\",\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"usage\":{\"input\":154,\"output\":259,\"cacheRead\":33369,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":33782,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1779581104527,\"responseId\":\"066173b114eca61e824296082c7a93c9\"}}[... 29401 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"persistedDetailsTruncated":true,"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast":8193,"originalDetailKeys":["status","exitCode","durationMs","aggregated","cwd"],"status":"completed","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus","exitCode":0},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779588722807}}
{"type":"message","id":"d703008d","parentId":"6006e22a","timestamp":"2026-05-24T02:12:02.814Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_af574d50547f4988b4b8ae78","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/home/node/.openclaw/cron/runs/config-backup-8am.jsonl\ntotal 28\ndrwx------  3 node node 4096 May 24 02:03 .\ndrwx------ 34 node node 4096 May 24 02:12 ..\n-rw-------  1 node node 4306 May 24 02:03 jobs-state.json\n-rw-------  1 node node 3309 May 17 02:46 jobs.json\n-rw-------  1 node node 3114 Apr 27 05:30 jobs.json.bak\ndrwx------  2 node node 4096 May 15 16:15 runs"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":54,"aggregated":"/home/node/.openclaw/cron/runs/config-backup-8am.jsonl\ntotal 28\ndrwx------  3 node node 4096 May 24 02:03 .\ndrwx------ 34 node node 4096 May 24 02:12 ..\n-rw-------  1 node node 4306 May 24 02:03 jobs-state.json\n-rw-------  1 node node 3309 May 17 02:46 jobs.json\n-rw-------  1 node node 3114 Apr 27 05:30 jobs.json.bak\ndrwx------  2 node node 4096 May 15 16:15 runs","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779588722807}}
